lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-1-hint = MOVE: Click Move, then click the highlighted hex. Movement spends your Move pool (not a Quick action).

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-2-hint = END TURN: When you are done acting, click End Turn to pass initiative to the enemy.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-3-hint = SKIRMISH: Click Skirmish, pick your Assault Rifle, then click the highlighted enemy to fire a Quick attack.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-4-hint = COVER: Soft rubble adds Difficulty to attacks through it. Move into the highlighted cover hex.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-5-hint = BOOST: Hard rubble blocks normal Move. Click Boost, then the highlighted hex — Boost ignores terrain but costs a Quick action.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-6-hint = LOCK ON: Click Lock On, then the highlighted enemy. Lock On applies automatically — they become Locked On.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-7-hint = LOCKED ATTACK: Skirmish the Locked On enemy. Consuming Lock On grants +1 Accuracy on that attack.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-8-hint = BARRAGE: Barrage is a Full action — pick two weapons, then one target. Both fire in sequence.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-9-hint = OVERCHARGE: Click Overcharge to gain an extra Quick action this turn. It also builds Heat.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-10-hint = STABILIZE: High Heat is dangerous. Click Stabilize, then Clear Heat to vent your reactor (Full action).

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-11-hint = OVERWATCH: End Turn. When the enemy starts a move inside your threat range, Accept Overwatch for a free attack.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-12-hint = BRACE: An incoming heavy hit is coming. Accept Brace to gain Resistance; your next turn is limited to one Quick action.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-13-hint = HEX: Click HEX, then the highlighted blast hex. Enemies in the blast make a save or take damage.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-14-hint = DISENGAGE: You are adjacent to a hostile (Engaged). Click Disengage (Full action) so melee no longer penalizes you this turn.

# TODO[新增] 值
lancer-arcade-tutorial-step-15-hint = FINISH: Eliminate the remaining hostiles with Skirmish. Campaign loadouts unlock more tools later.

